### Suggested Work Units

| Unit | Goal | Likely PR | Focused test command | Runtime harness | Rollback boundary |
|------|------|-----------|----------------------|-----------------|-------------------|
| 1 | Registry + CSV move + docs | PR 1 | `python -c "import pipeline.config"` with env unset / `bdca` / `foo` | `PIPELINE_DISENO=foo` → warn + fallback dca | revert `config.py`; restore CSV path |
| 2 | bdca analysis core (`cargar/eda/supuestos/modelos`) | PR 2 | `PIPELINE_DISENO=bdca python -c "from pipeline.bdca import modelos"` | run cargar→modelos on 36-row CSV | delete `pipeline/bdca/` |
| 3 | bdca reporting (`comparaciones/informe`) | PR 3 | full informe run; 5 result dirs populated | `PIPELINE_DISENO=bdca python -c "import pipeline.bdca.informe"` | delete `bdca/resultados` |
| 4 | Notebook generator bdca template | PR 4 | generate + execute `bdca/analisis_bdca.ipynb` | `PIPELINE_DISENO=bdca python generar_notebook_pipeline.py` | revert generator diff |
| 5 | Page + hub bdca | PR 5 | page renders; hub statuses | `python generar_pagina.py --diseno bdca; python generar_pagina.py --hub` | revert generator diff; regenerate hub |
| 6 | Run bdca + DCA regression/isolation | PR 6 | DCA `git diff` clean + `git status` isolation | full `PIPELINE_DISENO=bdca` run | delete `bdca/` + artifacts |

## Phase 1: Design registry (Foundation)

- [ ] 1.1 `pipeline/config.py`: add `DISENOS` dict (`dca`,`bdca`; nombre/dir_diseno/dir_crudos) + `_resolver_diseno_activo()` (env `PIPELINE_DISENO`, default `dca`, `warnings.warn` + fallback); resolve before the `mkdir` loop (config.py:53); derive `DIR_DISENO`/`DIR_CRUDOS` from `DISENOS[DISENO]`. Verify: unset→dca paths, `bdca`→bdca paths, `foo`→warn+dca.
- [ ] 1.2 Verify derived constants (`EXCEL_CRUDO`, `DIR_TABLAS`…) resolve under both designs via smoke import.

## Phase 2: Raw CSV relocation + traceability

- [ ] 2.1 `mv DBCA_Jenkyn_control_mildeo.csv` → `datos_crudos/bdca/` + `git add` (untracked file → `mv`, not `git mv`); byte-identical via `sha256sum`.
- [ ] 2.2 `AGENTS.md` §4: document bdca source path + schema `plot, trt, block, yield` + provenance rules.
- [ ] 2.3 Docstrings `pipeline/config.py`, `pipeline/limpiar.py`, `pipeline/informe.py`: reference `datos_crudos/bdca/` (docstring-only, no behavior change).

## Phase 3: pipeline/bdca/ modules (Core)

- [ ] 3.1 `pipeline/bdca/__init__.py` subpackage docstring (mirrors `pipeline/__init__.py`).
- [ ] 3.2 `cargar.py`: load CSV; audit 36 rows, 9/trt, 4/block, no NA/dups; anomalies reported, never imputed.
- [ ] 3.3 `eda.py`: descriptivos + IC95% per treatment (reuse `_ic95` pattern).
- [ ] 3.4 `supuestos.py`: Shapiro-Wilk, Levene, Durbin-Watson on block-ANOVA residuals; document chosen route.
- [ ] 3.5 `modelos.py`: `anova_bloques(df)` (`smf.ols("yield ~ C(trt)+C(block)")`, `anova_lm` typ=2), `lmm_bloques(df)` (`smf.mixedlm` groups=block, REML; ICC=`cov_re[0,0]/scale`); additivity-limitation note.
- [ ] 3.6 `comparaciones.py`: `posthoc_tukey(df)` (`pairwise_tukeyhsd`, 6 pairs, `vs_referencia_R` column); no Dunnett, no CLD.
- [ ] 3.7 `informe.py`: tables/figures (boxplot, residual diagnostics, tukey plot)/reports/excel via `guardar_tabla`, `save_figure_pub`, `exportar_excel`; every derived value documents source/formula/reason.

## Phase 4: Generator templates + hub

- [ ] 4.1 `generar_notebook_pipeline.py`: rename `construir_notebook()` → `construir_notebook_dca()`; add `construir_notebook_bdca()` (single-response, neutral Spanish); env-driven `SALIDA` → `bdca/analisis_bdca.ipynb`.
- [ ] 4.2 `generar_pagina.py`: `--diseno` choices `dca,bdca`; add `main_bdca()`; `generar_hub` writes placeholder only for `estado=="futuro"`; bdca card → activo/"Disponible".

## Phase 5: Run bdca pipeline

- [ ] 5.1 Run `PIPELINE_DISENO=bdca` end-to-end (notebook execution method pending — see Risks).
- [ ] 5.2 Verify `bdca/resultados/{database,tablas,figuras,reportes,excel}` populated; notebook executes; page renders.

## Phase 6: Regression & isolation verification

- [ ] 6.1 DCA regression guard: env unset → regenerate `dca/analisis_dca.ipynb` + `pagina/dca/index.html`; `git diff` clean.
- [ ] 6.2 Isolation: `git status` before/after bdca run — no file under `dca/` or `datos_crudos/dca/` created/modified.

